# Project inquiry delivery
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The contact form validates on the server, then POSTs the inquiry as JSON to
# this endpoint. It works with Formspree, n8n, Zapier, Make, a small custom
# handler, or any service that accepts a JSON webhook.
#
# If this is not set, the form will tell visitors that it is not connected yet
# and point them to the email address in src/content/site.ts.
#
# Never commit real secrets. Local values belong in .env.local (git-ignored).
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
